{"entries":[{"id":"lex:A1:draw","headword":"draw","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:draw","pos":"verb","gloss":"کشیدن؛ نقاشی کردن","meaning":"با مداد یا خودکار تصویر یا خط کشیدن. بی‌قاعده: drew، drawn. paint یعنی با رنگ نقاشی کردن.","grammar":[{"pattern":"draw – drew – drawn","note":"بی‌قاعده"},{"pattern":"draw a picture of + noun","note":"تصویرِ چیزی را کشیدن"},{"pattern":"draw / paint","note":"paint = با رنگ"}],"examples":[{"en":"My daughter likes to draw animals.","fa":"دخترم دوست دارد حیوان بکشد."},{"en":"He drew a map of the town for me.","fa":"او برایم نقشهٔ شهر را کشید."}],"collocations":["draw a picture","draw a line","draw a map","learn to draw"],"mistake":{"wrong":"She drawed a cat.","right":"She drew a cat.","why":"draw بی‌قاعده است: drew."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/drɔː/","us":"/drɔː/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Can you ___ a picture of your house?","answer":"draw","accept":["paint"],"fa":"می‌توانی تصویری از خانه‌ات بکشی؟","why":"draw a picture."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Yesterday the children ___ pictures of their families.","options":[{"text":"drew","ok":true,"why":"گذشتهٔ draw: drew."},{"text":"drawed","ok":false,"why":"draw بی‌قاعده است."},{"text":"drawn","ok":false,"why":"drawn بدون have نمی‌آید."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"او خیلی خوب نقاشی می‌کشد.","frame":"She can ___ very well.","answer":"draw","accept":["paint"],"why":"can + draw."}]}],"version":"88ff4a78a5b7","order":625,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:enjoy","headword":"enjoy","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:enjoy","pos":"verb","gloss":"لذت بردن","meaning":"از چیزی لذت بردن. enjoy + اسم یا -ing، نه to. enjoy yourself = خوش گذراندن. enjoy همیشه مفعول می‌خواهد.","grammar":[{"pattern":"enjoy + noun","note":"I enjoyed the film."},{"pattern":"enjoy + -ing","note":"I enjoy swimming."},{"pattern":"enjoy yourself","note":"خوش بگذران"}],"examples":[{"en":"Did you enjoy the party?","fa":"از مهمانی لذت بردی؟"},{"en":"I really enjoy cooking for my family.","fa":"واقعاً از آشپزی برای خانواده‌ام لذت می‌برم."}],"collocations":["enjoy the film","enjoy yourself","really enjoy","enjoy your meal"],"mistake":{"wrong":"I enjoy to read.","right":"I enjoy reading.","why":"بعد از enjoy، -ing می‌آید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/ɪnˈdʒɔɪ/","us":"/ɪnˈdʒɔɪ/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"We ___ the trip very much. It was great.","answer":"enjoyed","accept":["loved","liked"],"fa":"از سفر خیلی لذت بردیم. عالی بود.","why":"گذشته: enjoyed."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"My father enjoys ___ in the garden.","options":[{"text":"working","ok":true,"why":"enjoy + -ing."},{"text":"to work","ok":false,"why":"enjoy با to نمی‌آید."},{"text":"work","ok":false,"why":"بعد از enjoy، -ing لازم است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"خوش بگذره!","frame":"Have fun and ___ yourself!","answer":"enjoy","accept":[],"why":"enjoy yourself."}]}],"version":"5be0dfbd9753","order":626,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:false","headword":"false","goals":["study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:false","pos":"adjective","gloss":"غلط؛ نادرست","meaning":"درست نیست. در تمرین‌ها: true or false = درست یا غلط. false بیشتر برای جمله و اطلاعات است.","grammar":[{"pattern":"true or false","note":"درست یا غلط"},{"pattern":"be false","note":"نادرست بودن"},{"pattern":"false / wrong","note":"wrong هم رایج است"}],"examples":[{"en":"Read the sentences and write true or false.","fa":"جمله‌ها را بخوان و بنویس درست یا غلط."},{"en":"That story is false. It never happened.","fa":"آن داستان راست نیست. هرگز اتفاق نیفتاد."}],"collocations":["true or false","false information","a false name","completely false"],"mistake":{"wrong":"The answer is falsely.","right":"The answer is false.","why":"بعد از be صفت می‌آید، نه قید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/fɔːls/","us":"/fɔːls/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"'Cats can fly.' Is this true or ___?","answer":"false","accept":[],"fa":"«گربه‌ها می‌